      en: ["Founded in 1991 as a private initiative", "Protects over 700 hectares of Andean cloud forest", "Home to more than 330 documented bird species", "Site of the olinguito's discovery in 2013", "Located at an altitude between 1,650 and 2,350 meters", "Known for its distinctive dome-shaped architecture"],
